BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:Meetup: Toronto SUP, Kayak & Canoe
UID:event_314362722@meetup.com
SEQUENCE:1
DTSTAMP:20260531T043447Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260531T103000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260531T153000
SUMMARY:Kayak\, Canoe\, Stand-up Paddling Board on the scenic Humber River
 !
DESCRIPTION:Toronto SUP\, Kayak & Canoe Adventures - Meetup Group\n**Explo
 re the scenic Humber River in Toronto with our Kayak\, Canoe\, and stand-u
 p paddle board 2-hour rentals during the week!** Use the following link to
  book your spot:[ ](https://torontoadventures.ca/all-adventures/kayak-cano
 e-sup-rentals/)**[https://torontoadventures.ca/all-adventures/kayak-canoe-
 sup-rentals/](https://torontoadventures.ca/all-adventures/kayak-canoe-sup-
 rentals/)**[ ](https://torontoadventures.ca/all-adventures/kayak-canoe-sup
 -rentals/)\n\nThe calm meandering Humber River is one of Toronto’s hidde
 n gems! Home to a huge variety of wildlife\, including Beaver\, Blue Heron
 \, Deer and much more\, you’ll feel like you’ve left the city behind!\
 n\n*Events are subject to weather and other factors out of our control. If
  we must cancel or delay an event we will those booked on the [torontoadve
 ntures.ca](http://torontoadventures.ca/) website know as soon as possible.
 *\n\n**Weekend Pricing (per 2-hour rental)\, Payable online through:** [ht
 tps://torontoadventures.ca/all-adventures/kayak-canoe-sup-rentals/](https:
 //torontoadventures.ca/all-adventures/kayak-canoe-sup-rentals/)\nSingle Ka
 yak (seats 1 person) : $49.95+taxes\nTandem Kayak (seats 2 people) : $89.9
 5+taxes\nRegular Canoe (seats 2 people) : $79.95+taxes\nLarge Canoe (seats
  3 people) : $89.95+taxes\nStand-up Paddle Board ( 1 person): $49.95+taxes
 \n\n**Included:**\n\n* Boat(s)\, Paddle(s)\, PFD(s)/ “Life Jacket(s)”\
 , & Coast Guard Safety Kit.\n* Brief orientation covering paddling safety\
 , Toronto Adventures’ rules\, and the Humber River paddling route\n* Our
  friendly staff to help you launch your boat(s) and/or boards.\n* SUP Leas
 h (For Paddle Board Rentals Only)\n\n**What to bring?**\n\n* Dress for the
  weather!\n* Wear closed-toe athletic footwear you don’t mind getting we
 t & muddy (shoes not required on SUPs).\n* Sunscreen\, sunglasses & hats\,
  are all recommended for sunny days.\n* A water bottle.\n* Government Issu
 ed Photo ID.\n\n**Important Information**\nAnyone under the age of 18 must
  have a Parent/Guardian/Adult accompany them all the times on the water. O
 nline Adult Waivers are available through confirmation emails. For minors\
 , waivers will need to be signed in person on location. There must be an A
 dult to Child ratio of 1:4 in the children are under 12 years of age. From
  ages 12-18 we require a 1:5 adult to youth ratio. We have lifejackets sta
 rting at 30 pounds and are fully adjustable.\n\n* Paddlers must be comfort
 able treading water while wearing a PFD and reaching a shoreline (minimum 
 20 metres to shore).\n* Late Fees Returning Boat(s)/Equipment – $20/15 m
 inutes per boat.\n\n**[Google Link Directions](https://torontoadventures.c
 a/directions/#humberriverlocation)**\n**[Cancellation Policy](https://toro
 ntoadventures.ca/faq/#cancellation)**\n\nWe hope to see you out on the wat
 er!
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/torontoadventurers/events/314362722/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260419T122357Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260419T122357Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:Meetup: Toronto SUP, Kayak & Canoe
UID:event_314296862@meetup.com
SEQUENCE:1
DTSTAMP:20260531T043447Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260531T203000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260531T223000
SUMMARY:Full Moon Guided Night Paddle! - May 31st
DESCRIPTION:Toronto SUP\, Kayak & Canoe Adventures - Meetup Group\n**Join 
 us on our Full Moon Night Paddles on May 31st!** Use the following link to
  book your spot on our Full Moon Guided Night Tour: [https://torontoadvent
 ures.ca/all-adventures/full-moon-guided-tour/](https://torontoadventures.c
 a/all-adventures/full-moon-guided-tour/)\n\nSee Toronto’s Humber River l
 ike you’ve never seen it before!\n\nEnter Toronto’s calm\, meandering 
 Humber River at King’s Mill Park North. We paddle down as the full moon 
 guides our way to the mouth of Lake Ontario and towards a beautiful view o
 f Toronto’s skyline! We will have staff on the water in their own safety
  boats during this night time paddle!\n\n*Events are subject to weather an
 d other factors out of our control. If we must cancel or delay an event we
  will let those booked on the [torontoadventures.ca](http://torontoadventu
 res.ca/) website know as soon as possible.*\n\n**Pricing (per seat)\, Paya
 ble online through:** [https://torontoadventures.ca/all-adventures/full-mo
 on-guided-tour/](https://torontoadventures.ca/all-adventures/full-moon-gui
 ded-tour/)\nSingle Kayak (seats 1 person) : $50 +taxes\nTandem Kayak (seat
 s 2 people) : $90 +taxes\nRegular Canoe (seats 2 people) : $80 +taxes\nLar
 ge Canoe (seats 3 people) : $90 +taxes\nVoyageur Group (Per person) : $45 
 +taxes\n\n**What's Included:**\n\n* Boat(s)\n* Paddle(s)\n* PFD(s)/ "Life 
 Jacket(s)”\n* Coast Guard Safety Kit.\n* Our friendly staff to help you 
 every step of the way!\n\n**What to Bring:**\n\n* Dress for the weather!\n
 * Wear closed-toe athletic footwear you don’t mind getting wet & muddy.\
 n* It gets cooler at night so bring an extra layer!\n* A water bottle\n* G
 overnment Issued Photo ID.\n\n**More Information:**\n\n* Anyone under 18 m
 ust be accompanied on the water by an adult or legal guardian.\n* Waivers 
 Mandatory – sign the online waiver (available through order confirmation
 ) for each attendee.\n* We Start & Finish this event at our Humber Locatio
 n\, so no need for a shuttle.\n* Please arrive at least 15 minutes early f
 or Check-In.\n* Paddlers must be comfortable treading water while wearing 
 a PFD and reaching a shoreline (minimum 20 metres to shore).\n\n**[Google 
 Link Directions](https://torontoadventures.ca/directions/#humberriverlocat
 ion)**\n**[Cancellation Policy](https://torontoadventures.ca/faq/#cancella
 tion)**\n\nWe hope to see you out on the water!
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/torontoadventurers/events/314296862/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260415T150906Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260415T150906Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
